      "content": "it feels like i'm just a ghost lately. like, the person everyone used to know, the version of me that actually mattered online and in my circle... that person is just gone. i’m still walking around and breathing, but i feel like i’m just a hollow shell of what i used to be. everything feels so meaningless now.",
